        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃<strong>Run, Collect, Bake, Repeat!</strong>🏃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a colourful, low-poly world <strong>Let Him Bake </strong>is a fast-paced 3D corridor runner. Master your movement through tight procedurally generated obstacles, collecting ingredients such as<strong> Eggs🥚</strong>,<strong> Milk🥛</strong>, and<strong> Sugar🍚</strong>,<strong> </strong>to bake as many cookies as possible before you meet your inevitable end and return to your cozy café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💲Sell Sell Sell!💲</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning to your cozy café, sell your cookies to purchase some of the following upgrades:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <strong>💨Movement Speed Upgrade💨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🥚Ingredient Collection Multiplier🥚</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      ⏱️Bake Timer Upgrade⏱️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🍪Batch Multiplier Upgrade🍪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🤫[Redacted]</strong>🤫</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the upgrades are aimed at making your mastery of movement easier or for feeding your greedy desire to bake as many cookies as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️<strong>No Two Runs are the same!🏗️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the random procedurally generated layout, every run can be different. Will you get lucky with easy obstacle placements? Or will you be sent back to your café before you can bake your first batch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️<strong>Increasing Difficulty⚠️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While all those upgrades may make your runs begin to feel like walk in the park, just wait because the world and obstacles will come at you faster than you can say &quot;triple chocolate cookie!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍪<strong>Bake Your Way To Glory!🍪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max out all your upgrades to become a master of movement, artfully dodging and weaving your way around any oncoming obstacle. Progress from humbly baking a dozen cookies to become a corporate tycoon producing cookies in great abundance. Get ready to dodge, collect, and bake your way to glory—your cookie awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😎<strong>Try-Hard or Casual?😎</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are trying to speedrun your way to maxing out all upgrades and achievements or just looking for a chill game to hop on and listen to its jazzy tunes,<strong> Let Him Bake</strong> allows all players to take it at their own pace and most importantly to have fun! (it is but a game overall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃<strong>Run, Collect, Bake, Repeat!</strong>🏃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a colourful, low-poly world <strong>Let Him Bake </strong>is a fast-paced 3D corridor runner. Master your movement through tight procedurally generated obstacles, collecting ingredients such as<strong> Eggs🥚</strong>,<strong> Milk🥛</strong>, and<strong> Sugar🍚</strong>,<strong> </strong>to bake as many cookies as possible before you meet your inevitable end and return to your cozy café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💲Sell Sell Sell!💲</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning to your cozy café, sell your cookies to purchase some of the following upgrades:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <strong>💨Movement Speed Upgrade💨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🥚Ingredient Collection Multiplier🥚</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      ⏱️Bake Timer Upgrade⏱️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🍪Batch Multiplier Upgrade🍪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      🤫[Redacted]</strong>🤫</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the upgrades are aimed at making your mastery of movement easier or for feeding your greedy desire to bake as many cookies as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️<strong>No Two Runs are the same!🏗️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the random procedurally generated layout, every run can be different. Will you get lucky with easy obstacle placements? Or will you be sent back to your café before you can bake your first batch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️<strong>Increasing Difficulty⚠️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While all those upgrades may make your runs begin to feel like walk in the park, just wait because the world and obstacles will come at you faster than you can say &quot;triple chocolate cookie!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍪<strong>Bake Your Way To Glory!🍪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max out all your upgrades to become a master of movement, artfully dodging and weaving your way around any oncoming obstacle. Progress from humbly baking a dozen cookies to become a corporate tycoon producing cookies in great abundance. Get ready to dodge, collect, and bake your way to glory—your cookie awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😎<strong>Try-Hard or Casual?😎</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are trying to speedrun your way to maxing out all upgrades and achievements or just looking for a chill game to hop on and listen to its jazzy tunes,<strong> Let Him Bake</strong> allows all players to take it at their own pace and most importantly to have fun! (it is but a game overall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Dash through a colorful, low-poly world, dodge obstacles, and collect ingredients to bake as many cookies as you can! Sell your baked goods to upgrade your speed, collection, and baking power. Procedurally generated runs and escalating difficulty keep every attempt fresh.",
